sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor B as Browser
    participant A as App server
    participant C as LRU cache
    participant R as Read replica
    participant P as Primary DB
    participant Q as Click queue
    B->>A: GET /4xdNF0v
    A->>C: get 4xdNF0v
    C-->>A: miss
    A->>R: SELECT url, expires_at FROM links WHERE code = ?
    alt found on the replica
        R-->>A: url, expires_at
    else not there yet, replication lag
        A->>P: the same SELECT
        P-->>A: url, expires_at
    end
    A->>C: put 4xdNF0v, Found link
    A-)Q: offer 4xdNF0v
    A-->>B: 302 Found, Location: https://example.com/...
    Note over Q,P: a batch writer upserts clicks_daily every 200 ms
